SUMMARY:Sri Gauravirbhava Paurnamasi. Sri Gaura Purnima. Divine appearance of Sri Gauranga. <strong>Total fast until moonrise,</strong> then no grains. Grand festival at Sri Chaitanya Saraswat Math. Vasantotsav and Dol Yatra of Sri Sri Radha-Govinda. Special offering of worship and arati. Sri Chaitanya-charitamrita reading and mahasankirtan. End of year 540 Gaurabda.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT3H
ACTION:DISPLAY
